Function for formatted input and output.  
1. cin (Input)  
#include <iostream>  
using namespace std;  
 
int main() {  
    int x; 
    cin >> x;  
    cout << x;  
} 
Input:  
5 
Output:  
5 
 
2. cout  (Output)  
#include <iostream>  
using namespace std;  
 
int main() {  
    cout << "Hello";  
} 
Output:  
Hello 
 
